    <briefdescription>
<para>Multi-tier LRU cache: HOT / WARM / COLD with weighted scoring. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Tiers hold at most the given capacity. On overflow the lowest-score entry in that tier is demoted to the next tier (or evicted from COLD). Score = freq_weight * log(1+access_count) + recency_weight * last_access_ts </para>
    </detaileddescription>
